function historyEventISO(ev){if(!ev?.date)return"";let time=/^\d{2}:\d{2}/.test(String(ev.time||""))?String(ev.time).slice(0,5):"12:00",d=new Date(`${ev.date}T${time}:00`);return Number.isNaN(d.getTime())?"":d.toISOString()}
